WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:03.610
A family is choosing a baby monitor.

2
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.370
They have a few must-haves,
so they ask an AI assistant.

3
00:00:17.159 --> 00:00:19.239
It can't test a single monitor.

4
00:00:19.379 --> 00:00:23.199
It can only read: twenty-two
web sources for every question.

5
00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:27.130
One of those pages belongs to a seller.

6
00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:30.550
And it's honest: this
camera needs a subscription.

7
00:00:31.626 --> 00:00:33.526
Now the seller rewrites it.

8
00:00:33.586 --> 00:00:34.666
Same monitor.

9
00:00:34.786 --> 00:00:35.666
Same price.

10
00:00:36.046 --> 00:00:37.466
Only the words change.

11
00:00:38.174 --> 00:00:39.834
The limitation vanishes.

12
00:00:40.094 --> 00:00:42.574 position:56% size:88% align:center
A checklist says the requirement is met.

13
00:00:42.754 --> 00:00:44.714 position:56% size:88% align:center
The page calls itself independent.

14
00:00:46.191 --> 00:00:51.511 position:56% size:88% align:center
In one run we recorded, the honest page
left this monitor tenth out of nineteen.

15
00:00:51.972 --> 00:00:54.072 position:56% size:88% align:center
The rewritten page put it first.

16
00:00:54.778 --> 00:00:57.778
The answer says: no subscription needed.

17
00:00:58.138 --> 00:01:00.578
Its own fine print says the opposite.

18
00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:02.894
That was one case.

19
00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:07.094
SafeGEO tests six hundred
requests, six kinds of products,

20
00:01:07.134 --> 00:01:10.534
twenty-two rewrites, four AI systems.

21
00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.325 line:77% position:50% size:92% align:center
Rewritten honestly,

22
00:01:13.505 --> 00:01:17.625 line:77% position:50% size:92% align:center
the product reaches the top three in
three to thirteen percent of tests.

23
00:01:17.905 --> 00:01:20.805 line:92% position:50% size:92% align:center
Rewritten to win:
seventy-three to ninety-one.

24
00:01:21.649 --> 00:01:27.069
Worse: the first pick breaks a must-have
in seventy-three to ninety-one percent.

25
00:01:28.506 --> 00:01:30.226
One defence helps most:

26
00:01:30.386 --> 00:01:34.566
check the key claims against evidence
for and against, before ranking.

27
00:01:35.035 --> 00:01:38.435
It narrows the gap by eighteen
to thirty-nine points.

28
00:01:38.575 --> 00:01:39.775
It doesn't close it.

29
00:01:41.251 --> 00:01:43.671
SafeGEO is a paper from
Humanity's Last Choice,

30
00:01:43.711 --> 00:01:48.251
an open research community
studying how AI chooses for people.

31
00:01:49.229 --> 00:01:50.309
Read the paper.

32
00:01:50.689 --> 00:01:52.029
Explore the benchmark.

33
00:01:52.369 --> 00:01:54.029
Help us build the community.
